  "receiving_requirements": {
    "conditional_next_length_route": "Only consider next listed length for a specific stack if existing-length assignment cannot satisfy the dimensional window. Longer stock needs a shorter actual gaged grip/thread-start that allows this nut seat, and its enlarged outward tip/tool/removal envelope needs its own check; neither is inherited from frozen nominal CAD.",
    "criteria": [
      "L >= S + w_head + w_nut + h_nut + 2*pitch, with sound full-seat contact and the actual threaded end extending through the nut",
      "The matching nut runs fully to the required washer seat without stopping on body/runout; applicable full-body cap-screw Lgmax <= S+w_head+w_nut is a conservative purchase-window comparison, not a substitute for delivered threading/fillet/washer-fit inspection",
      "Keep two own washers, matching nut, thread pitch and individual bolt identity; no extra washer packing, cut bolt, full-thread substitution, thinner selection or external preload/friction assumed",
      "Record Actual/Disposition at receipt and dry assembly, including bolt length, washer/nut stack, free nut seating, tip protrusion and tool/removal clearance. No actual values filled by this arithmetic"
    ],
    "preferred_purchase_route": "Retain existing lengths and matching Grade5 nuts/USS washers as proposed. Allocate24 flagged stacks individually using measured underhead L, seated receiver/plate thickness S, two washer thicknesses and nut height. Prefer qualifying existing-length bolts at catalog maximum stack before selecting thinner washers. An alternative within-range washer pair must also retain its separate bending/seat/material qualification; the stack inequality alone is dimensional.",
    "tool_scope": "Reference wrench sizes9/16 and3/4in from merchant bolt pages. Actual socket wall/depth, open-wrench swing and withdrawal swept clearance are not supplied. The computed protrusion is the minimum axial free length inside a closed socket beyond the nut's outboard face, plus unquantified tool allowance.",
